ely no hazardous materials, making them safe for any room and convenient to recycle.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Beautiful, switched on and off</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Light can have different color temperatures, indicated in units called Kelvin (K). Bulbs with a low value produce a warm, more cozy light, while those with a high Kelvin value, create a cool, more energizing light.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Avoid the hassle of changing Lights</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The durable alternative to incandescent light bulbs, Photon LED <b> Downlight </b> can be installed and forgotten about, maintaining their beautiful light beam for years and years to come.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0333/6745/7925/files/des_icon_img.png\"></p>\n<h2>Applications</h2>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: square;\">Home</li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: square;\">Office</li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: square;\">Malls</li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: square;\">Hospitality</li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: square;\">Commercial Area</li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: square;\">Shops</li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: square;\">Other General Use</li>\n</ul>", "published_at": "2024-08-29T15:49:58+05:00", "created_at": "2021-01-07T10:46:36+05:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-17T22:39:58+05:00", "vendor": "Orient", "product_type": "Downlights", "tags": ["10 Watt", "3000K", "4 inch", "6800K", "COB", "DAY LIGHT", "DOWN LIGHT", "HOTEL", "OL-CS10B", "ORIENT", "ROUND", "WARM LIGHT"], "variants": [{"id": 34822241124485, "title": "Round / DAY LIGHT", "option1": "Round", "option2": "DAY LIGHT", "option3": null, "sku": "300000000604", "requires_shipping": true, "taxable": false, "featured_image": {"id": 17722257866885, "product_id": 5234048172165, "position": 1, "created_at": "2021-02-02T16:08:09+05:00", "updated_at": "2021-02-02T16:08:09+05:00", "alt": null, "width": 2000, "height": 2000, "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0333/6745/7925/products/OL-CS10B.jpg?v=1612264089", "variant_ids": [34822241124485, 3482224